{"time": 1754760466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786151576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(归根结底还是不信露莉亚，现在要把七海害死了)"}
{"time": 1754760471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889711499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=0F23AD19D77B3046EF758DEA23C8F3A6.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhReqHBoBX3Nmqxq2RB9MkBc8iWjkxiiwwMg_wooobuQlKD-jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ3ZIIYizXOPzXJ2cH7XCgj3oCrY4&amp;rkey=CAESMI18gKNXdLMgbIfrYeoMIVbx_8kyQz49kqENyHDecaMeQpRGNoaLmzuMPWL4ZX-SIw,file_size=57762]"}
{"time": 1754760475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283082540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你对露莉亚是不是要求太高了）"}
{"time": 1754760500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702770002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（露莉亚比我想象的坚强只能说（）"}
{"time": 1754760507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356753281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我低估她了（）"}
{"time": 1754760513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743644678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1754760578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120038197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2120558151]\"这本来不就是我家吗？\"她被你拎起来，顺便伸了个懒腰，\"大忙人终于回来啦？和白龙小姐相处得怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1754760738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270952882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明知故问。拜你所赐，现在我真的得考虑绝后的事情了”*挤开她后，先想办法测量一下琳恩淡淡血液中的龙血含量"}
{"time": 1754760773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296560881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1608542591]\"好孩子可不会和父母提条件。\"你仍然被吊着，伤口虽然被签子堵住，但仍然有血缓缓下流，她们手脚麻利，很快把还在喘气的露莉亚也一起吊了起来，\"本来还打算慢慢玩，反正过了今夜就好了。\"女人摊摊手，伸手掐着你的脸，\"可别活着哦。\""}
{"time": 1754760848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812662784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1270952882]\"完不成血契的后果，小伊芙也想好了?艾琳妈妈真可怜呜呜。\"她从后面靠在你背上，一边假哭着，\"这个家完啦\""}
{"time": 1754760866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969303445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的...爸爸妈妈再见...”最后两个字咬的很重，但声音却很小...已经没有大声说话的力气了"}
{"time": 1754760952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821068728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真乖。\"她摸了摸你的头发，\"可惜白头发不太好看，我之后果然要染成黑的。\"说着就拉着男人出去了。卧室门被关上，只剩下你和露莉亚被吊在空中"}
{"time": 1754760993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234167049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起露露......都是因为我..”"}
{"time": 1754761114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649485514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=812662784]“我答应的事情，除了你的，我都会完成的，用不着你担心”*从冰晶上磨下一些，加热到室温"}
{"time": 1754761319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075788789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234167049]露莉亚身上全是伤痕和血迹，吊在空中轻轻晃着，垂着头完全没回话，也不知道状态怎么样"}
{"time": 1754761442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203059933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1649485514]这种冰晶似乎可以保持很长时间不融化，至少在你加热之前完全没有融化的迹象，加热过了才勉强开始烧熔，\"哎呀，可惜我的你也要好好做才是。\"她笑的亲切，又往你的坩埚里扔了几片血晶"}
