{"time": 1754837747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569462764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看房间内有没有什么值得注意的的妙妙工具"}
{"time": 1754837765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222930394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也没指望我付得起”*耸肩“说说而已。果然完成不了……”"}
{"time": 1754837826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "918311972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……说到底也就只是个空有执念的普通人，虽然比真正的普通人应该好些”*趴桌“没有师母她们在，什么都做不好”"}
{"time": 1754837826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541242392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "可以打开窗户跳出去吗"}
{"time": 1754837898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799708193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过..幻境内复制的东西真的有原本的作用吗”把头上绑一半的缎带拿下来看有没有什么魔法气息"}
{"time": 1754838264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025075328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1754838315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254578539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=918311972]\"不过，虽然有些难，但是我给出的条件也不会怎么超出你的能力范围。\"她伸出手，你的被子自动卷成披肩披在她身上，\"而且...你是不是变软弱了？不考虑一下吗？\""}
{"time": 1754838336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791227584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（误会你了，哭没那塞）"}
{"time": 1754838413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94915535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1799708193]这只是普通的缎带，和你原本的都不是一条。窗户似乎被锁上了，你没有钥匙。此外，卧室里应该也没什么东西了。"}
{"time": 1754838561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607360441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像只能走正门了...”"}
{"time": 1754838753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828579342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1254578539]“……哈，你是这么觉得的？”*靠在椅背上，看着前不久还在冒泡的坩埚“只是一腔热血过了，然后发现遇到的问题都解决不了”"}
{"time": 1754838785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611987262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=607360441]\"...外面还有那两个东西...\"露莉亚皱着眉，\"而且...我不能确定村子里那些...是不是他们的同类。\""}
{"time": 1754838839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981433148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不我们之间把窗户砸碎，露露有没有什么降低声音的方法”"}
{"time": 1754838844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19231473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（直接）"}
{"time": 1754838896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428526276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=828579342]\"你才十六岁，你能遇到什么问题?\"她的语气不屑，走到你面前居高临下看着你，\"犯了点不属于自己的青春期偏执，一腔热血?那就证明看看啊？\""}
{"time": 1754838951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13037031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=981433148]\"我要是什么都会，还会和诺诺一起困在这里吗？\"她瞪了你一眼，\"我去引开他们，还不如这个。\""}
{"time": 1754838991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003924137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行，感觉不如我去引开它们...我天天锻炼，身体素质怎么样也会比露露好一点..”"}
{"time": 1754839161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680000624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果考虑引开了的话，好像还不如直接把窗户砸开，然后朝石碑那里跑，反正也不是特别远...”"}
{"time": 1754839316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677764776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1428526276]“别用那种眼神看我”*皱眉“想靠自己做点什么，这也有错？关心我的，我关心的，现在一个比一个糟，而我解决问题的方法是把我卖出去然后等人给我收拾烂摊子。我需要向你证明什么？证明我很坚强？……”"}
{"time": 1754839412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212332902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1680000624]\"...万一村子里都是这种怪物该怎么办?\"她比你想的更多，\"声音太大了\""}
{"time": 1754839480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907163204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....那这样的话，还是我去引开吧...到时候有可能要被一个村子的怪物追逐...”"}
{"time": 1754839534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783707856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1677764776]\"明明是你向我索取吧？\"她摆摆手退后几步，摆出无可奈何的样子，\"现在这幅样子是想怎样啦，你想解决什么问题?你现在关心什么问题呢？\""}
{"time": 1754839592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77811414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1907163204]\"你?\"她看着你的腹部，皱了皱眉毛\"弱不禁风的样子，你能跑过谁。\""}
{"time": 1754839826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800037186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道，可能是最近生活太圆满了）"}
{"time": 1754839830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48176493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...这点伤不算什么....”虽然确实很疼但逞强的说到"}
{"time": 1754839833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128892127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（偏执不动了）"}
{"time": 1754839960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99201177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说明该放下了)"}
{"time": 1754839989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45004576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=48176493]\"好啦，所以说，就算是做诱饵，也得是我去做才对\""}
{"time": 1754840064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197251474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主要是关系也还没那么好）"}
